<title>FRANCE: France postpones food aid tenders to April 2 - ONIC.</title>
<headline>France postpones food aid tenders to April 2 - ONIC.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>France will on April 2 hold food aid tenders initially scheduled for March 26, national grain office ONIC said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The tenders are for the supply of 2,500 tonnes of soft wheat to Zaire and of 730 tonnes of wheat flour to Sao Tome, it said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
